## Proposed Changes
### scripts

#### [NEW] `scripts/run_overnight_mac.sh`
This script will be pushed to Edward's Mac and run via `nohup`.
It will:
1. Wait for the currently running `soft` ablation to finish (by monitoring the process).
2. Run B0/B0b using the newly-minted `soft` outputs (just to have the stats for the soft run).
3. Re-run the default null (`score_critique`) with `SEED=default_null` to cleanly recreate the N=1000 checkpoints and run B0/B0b on them.
4. Run B4 `verdict` ablation with `SEED=verdict`.
5. Run B4 `logit_kd` ablation with `SEED=logit_kd` and `KD_TEACHER=Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct`.

